@startuml ad-03-pickup-verification
!include ../_style.iuml
title AD-03 · Order verification and payment at store pickup (UC-06, BR-09, BR-18)

|Customer|
start
:Arrive at the store counter;
:Present order code\n(Meu pedido screen or written);
repeat
  |Store staff|
  :Type the code and open order page /orders/{code};
  |System|
  :Find order by code;
repeat while (Not found and code mistyped?) is (yes: re-type) not (no)
if (Order found?) then (no)
  |Store staff|
  :Do not hand over;\noffer to take a new order at the counter;
  stop
else (yes)
endif
|System|
:Show code, status, items, quantities,\n"Total a pagar na loja", first name only;
|Store staff|
if (Status = AWAITING_PICKUP?) then (yes)
  :Gather the listed items;
  :Charge the total at the counter\n(any method the store accepts);
  |Customer|
  :Pay;
  |Store staff|
  :Hand over the cupcakes;
  |Customer|
  :Receive the order;
  note right
    Recording payment and PICKED_UP
    in the app is future work
    (out of MVP scope).
  end note
  stop
else (no: already picked up, future)
  |Store staff|
  :Explain that the order was already collected;
  stop
endif
@enduml
